DESCRIPTION:Join us for Knittin' in the Corner\, where yarn and laughter i
 ntertwine! \n\nWhether you're a purling pro or just learning the ropes\, c
 ome share your latest projects\, tips\, and a few stitches of humor.\n\n W
 e meet every Tuesday at 5 PM in the cozy corner of the library (the activi
 ty room). \n\nBring your favorite yarn\, your best jokes\, and let’s kni
 t our way through another delightful evening!\n \n\nCheck out these Knitti
 ng and Crochet books from the Library!\n\nKnitting for Babies and Toddlers
 : 35 Projects to Make: Timeless Patterns for Clothes\, Blankets\, and Nurs
 ery Decorations\n\nThe beginner's guide to knitting: easy techniques and 8
  fun projects\n\nTunisian crochet for beginners: patterns for beautifully 
 textured accessories\, decorations\, blankets\, and more\n\nKnitted scarve
 s & cowls: 35 quick and stylish patterns suitable for knitters of all abil
 ities
