BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cypress Gardens: Berkeley County Residents: Free Day! and Berkeley
  County Emergency Services Day!
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTSTAMP:20261114T000000Z
UID:LibCal-8209-17396645
CATEGORIES:Adult, Children, Family, Teen
DESCRIPTION:\n\nFree admission for Berkeley County residents!\n\nCypress G
 ardens Events: https://cypressgardens.berkeleycountysc.gov/events/\n\nNove
 mber 14\, 2026: Berkeley County Residents: Free Day and Fall Plant Sale.\n
 \nPark Map: https://cypressgardens.berkeleycountysc.gov/maps/\n\nDirection
 s to: Cypress Gardens\, 3030 Cypress Gardens Rd\, Moncks Corner\, SC 29461
 \n\nContact & Visitor Info: \nPhone: (843) 553-0515\nWeb: https://cypressg
 ardens.berkeleycountysc.gov/about/contact-visitor-info/\n\nBerkeley County
  Emergency Services Day Returns to Cypress Gardens\n\nSaturday\, November 
 14\n\nCypress Gardens will host its annual Berkeley County Emergency Servi
 ces Day on Saturday\, November 14\, from 10 a.m. – 2 p.m. at the park\, 
 located at 3030 Cypress Gardens Road in Moncks Corner.\n\nFamilies will be
  able to meet and interact with Berkeley County first responders\, represe
 ntatives from state agencies\, and more. There will also be live demonstra
 tions\, emergency vehicles on display\, and information on preparedness.\n
 \nBerkeley County Emergency Services Day coincides with the park’s Free 
 Saturday event for Berkeley County residents. Proof of residency is requir
 ed for free admission. Food trucks and craft vendors will be on site. The 
 park is open 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. (with last admission at 4 p.m.).\n\n
URL:https://berkeleylibrarysc.libcal.com/event/17396645
